{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, adjoint⊗adjoint: overlap formula in the diagonal frame\n\nGoal: the two-site version of row 19 of `Companion-B-C-diagonalize-clean.md`, i.e. the overlap of the rotated $w$-vacuum with a diagonal-twist eigenstate written as a determinant of $Q$'s. Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-01-L2-diagonal-frame-overlap-design.md`. The first code cell clears the kernel.\n\n**Conventions** (new, as in the clean L=1 notebook).\n- **Lax.** $\\mathcal L_{ij}(u)=u\\,\\delta_{ij}+h\\,E_{ij}$; two sites, $T(u)=\\mathcal L^{(1)}(u-\\theta_1)\\,\\mathcal L^{(2)}(u-\\theta_2)$ (product in auxiliary space).\n- **Twist.** Diagonal, $T^z=T\\,\\mathrm{diag}(z)$. No companion frame anywhere.\n- **Quantum minors.** Rows antisymmetrized, column $k$ at $u-(k-1)h$; $t_a=\\sum_{|I|=a}\\mathrm{qmin}_{I,I}$.\n- **Factors.** $\\nu_n(u)=\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s+h\\lambda_n)$ (the L=1 factor, multiplied over sites).\n- **Q-functions.** Direct $Q_i=z_i^{-u/h}q_i$, dual $Q^j=z_j^{+u/h}q^j$, monic $q$'s.\n\n**Numeric point** (exact rationals; 60 digits where floats enter): $h=1/2$, $\\theta=(2/7,-3/5)$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state; this also clears the other new-conventions notebooks' session state (their files are untouched) *)\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;\n(* rep, numeric point, two-site generators *)\nΛ = {2, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2];\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wN = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}; prec = 60;\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d1]];\nE2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d1], Ee[i, j]];\n(* total gl(3) weight of each product basis state, in KroneckerProduct order *)\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nnuP[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\n{d2, Length[Union[wtBasis]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.\nClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.\nClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
