  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Two-site transfer matrices (diagonal twist)\n$t_a(u)$ has degree $\\le 2a\\le 6$ in $u$, so it is rebuilt exactly (Lagrange) from 7 rational sample points; each sample is an exact $64\\times64$ product. Checks: the quantum determinant $t_3=\\chi_3\\,\\nu_1(u)\\nu_2(u-h)\\nu_3(u-2h)$, commutativity, and weight conservation (the diagonal twist commutes with the Cartan).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* monodromy at a numeric argument v: aux-space product L^(1)(v-θ1).L^(2)(v-θ2) *)\nTm[v_] := Tm[v] = Table[Sum[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[1]]) id2 + hN E1[i, k]) . (KroneckerDelta[k, j] (v - thN[[2]]) id2 + hN E2[k, j]), {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n(* twist M on the right, T^M = T.M; quantum minor: rows antisymmetrized, column k at v-(k-1)h *)\nTMf[M_][i_, j_][v_] := Sum[Tm[v][[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}];\nqminor[M_][I_, J_][v_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[TMf[M][σ[[k]], J[[k]]][v - (k - 1) hN], {k, Length[J]}], {σ, Permutations[I]}];\ntAt[M_, a_, v_] := Sum[qminor[M][I, I][v], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nuS = 1/7 + Range[0, 6]/3;\ntPoly[M_, a_] := Expand[Sum[tAt[M, a, uS[[k]]] Product[(u - uS[[l]])/(uS[[k]] - uS[[l]]), {l, DeleteCases[Range[7], k]}], {k, 7}]];\nZd = DiagonalMatrix[zN]; χ3z = Times @@ zN;\n{tTime, tZ} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[tPoly[Zd, a], {a, 3}]];\nchecks[\"qdet: t3 = χ3 ν1(u)ν2(u-h)ν3(u-2h)\"] = Union[Flatten[Expand[tZ[[3]] - χ3z nuP[1][u] nuP[2][u - hN] nuP[3][u - 2 hN] id2]]] === {0};\nchecks[\"deg t_a = 2a\"] = Table[Max[Exponent[tZ[[a]], u]], {a, 3}] === {2, 4, 6};\nchecks[\"[t_a(u1), t_b(u2)] = 0\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[With[{A = tZ[[a]] /. u -> 1/3, B = tZ[[b]] /. u -> -2/5}, Union[Flatten[A . B - B . A]] === {0}], {a, 3}, {b, 3}]];\nchecks[\"t_a conserve the weight\"] = And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[Table[If[wtBasis[[r]] =!= wtBasis[[c]], tZ[[a, r, c]], 0], {r, d2}, {c, d2}]]] === {0}, {a, 3}];\nGrid[Prepend[Append[List @@@ Normal[checks], {\"build time (s)\", tTime}], {\"check\", \"value\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"138\" data-out-n=\"1051\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1051]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">check</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qdet: t3 = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mord\">3 </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">1(u)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">2(u-h)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">3(u-2h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg t_a = 2a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[t_a(u1), t_b(u2)] = 0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t_a conserve the weight</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">build time (s)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3.899761</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1051]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{check} & \\text{value}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet: t3 = $\\chi$3 $\\nu$1(u)$\\nu$2(u-h)$\\nu$3(u-2h)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{deg t\\_a = 2a} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{[t\\_a(u1), t\\_b(u2)] = 0} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{t\\_a conserve the weight} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{build time (s)} & 3.899761\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
