  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Baxter equations and QQ relation at L=2\nThe L=1 equations with each $\\nu_n$ replaced by the two-site product $\\nu_n(x)=\\prod_s(x-\\theta_s+h\\lambda_n)$:\n$$\\nu_1(x)\\nu_1(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)Q(x-h)-t_1(x)\\nu_1(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)Q(x)+t_2(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)Q(x+h)-t_3(x+2h)Q(x+2h)=0,$$\n$$\\nu_3(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)Q(x+h)-t_1(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)Q(x)+t_2(x)\\nu_3(x-2h)Q(x-h)-t_3(x)Q(x-2h)=0.$$\nExpected degrees: $\\deg q_i=L\\lambda_1-\\mu_i$, $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j-L\\lambda_3$. QQ factor $F_\\lambda=\\prod_s\\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}(u-\\theta_s+nh)$. The solver searches the minimal degree up to 6, so the degree rule is a test, not an input.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "opDir[tt_, Q_, x_] := nuP[1][x] nuP[1][x + hN] nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nuP[1][x + hN] nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hN) nuP[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hN) Q[x + 2 hN];\nopDual[tt_, Q_, x_] := nuP[3][x] nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nuP[3][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x) nuP[3][x - 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x) Q[x - 2 hN];\n(* minimal-degree monic q with Q = zz^(s x/h) q solving op; {} if none up to degree 6 *)\nsolveQ[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{c, eqs, ns, res = {}},\n  Do[If[res === {},\n    eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - X)/hN) Sum[c[j] yy^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X];\n    ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n    If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 6}]; res];\n{qTime, {qd, qu}} = AbsoluteTiming[{Table[solveQ[opDir, vals[[A]], zN[[i]], -1], {A, nS}, {i, 3}], Table[solveQ[opDual, vals[[A]], zN[[j]], 1], {A, nS}, {j, 3}]}];\nchecks[\"all direct and dual Q's found\"] = FreeQ[{qd, qu}, {}];\nchecks[\"deg q_i = Lλ1 - μ_i\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Exponent[qd[[A, i]], X] == nL Λ[[1]] - muS[[A, i]], {A, nS}, {i, 3}]];\nchecks[\"deg q^j = μ_j - Lλ3\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Exponent[qu[[A, j]], X] == muS[[A, j]] - nL Λ[[3]], {A, nS}, {j, 3}]];\nFlam[x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + n hN, {s, nL}, {n, Λ[[2]] + 1, Λ[[1]]}];\nchecks[\"QQ: Q_a Q_b^[2] - Q_b Q_a^[2] = (1/z_b-1/z_a) F Q^c\"] = Max[Table[With[{q = qd[[A]], qc = qu[[A, abc[[3]]]], a = abc[[1]], b = abc[[2]]},\n     maxc[q[[a]] (q[[b]] /. X -> X + hN)/zN[[b]] - q[[b]] (q[[a]] /. X -> X + hN)/zN[[a]] - (1/zN[[b]] - 1/zN[[a]]) Flam[X] qc, X]], {A, nS}, {abc, {{1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 1}, {3, 1, 2}}}]];\nGrid[Prepend[Append[Table[{k, checks[k]}, {k, {\"all direct and dual Q's found\", \"deg q_i = Lλ1 - μ_i\", \"deg q^j = μ_j - Lλ3\", \"QQ: Q_a Q_b^[2] - Q_b Q_a^[2] = (1/z_b-1/z_a) F Q^c\"}}], {\"solve time (s)\", qTime}], {\"check\", \"value\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"140\" data-out-n=\"1071\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1071]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">check</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all direct and dual Q’s found</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg q_i = L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 - </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_j - L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QQ: Q_a Q_b</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">[2] - Q_b Q_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">[2] = (1/z_b-1/z_a) F Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">solve time (s)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.500684</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1071]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{check} & \\text{value}\\\\\\hline\\text{all direct and dual Q's found} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{deg q\\_i = L$\\lambda$1 - $\\mu$\\_i} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{deg q\\^{}j = $\\mu$\\_j - L$\\lambda$3} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{QQ: Q\\_a Q\\_b\\^{}[2] - Q\\_b Q\\_a\\^{}[2] = (1/z\\_b-1/z\\_a) F Q\\^{}c} & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{solve time (s)} & 0.500684\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
