   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. The rotated $w$-vacuum bra\nFrom the L=1 notebook: $P_{\\rm aux}G(z)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}=\\mathrm{diag}(z)$, and the second twist written in this diagonal frame is $G'=P_{\\rm aux}G(w)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}$. At L=1 its vacuum covector is $\\Omega_{zw}=e_1^T e^{r_1E_{12}}e^{r_2E_{13}}e^{r_3E_{23}}$. A global rotation acts as $g\\otimes g$, so at L=2 the claim is $\\Omega^{(2)}=\\Omega_{zw}\\otimes\\Omega_{zw}$, a left eigenvector of every $t_a(G')$ with $t_1=\\sum_jw_j\\nu_j(u)$. Its direct $Q$'s, $Q_{i,{\\rm vac}}=w_i^{-u/h}q_i$, come from the direct Baxter equation with these eigenvalues.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nzs = {z[1], z[2], z[3]}; ws = {w[1], w[2], w[3]};\nχ[tw_] := {tw[[1]] + tw[[2]] + tw[[3]], tw[[1]] tw[[2]] + tw[[1]] tw[[3]] + tw[[2]] tw[[3]], tw[[1]] tw[[2]] tw[[3]]};\nGc[tw_] := With[{c = χ[tw]}, {{c[[1]], -c[[2]], c[[3]]}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}}];\n(* auxiliary-space Gauss factors, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nPpa = MatrixExp[-(1/z[1]) ee[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[(1/(z[1] z[2])) ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[-((z[1] + z[2])/(z[1] z[2])) ee[3, 2]];\nPma = MatrixExp[-r[1] ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-r[2] ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-r[3] ee[1, 2]];\nPda = MatrixExp[-Log[s[1]] ee[1, 1]] . MatrixExp[-Log[s[2]] ee[2, 2]] . MatrixExp[-Log[s[3]] ee[3, 3]];\nrsSol = {s[1] -> z[1]^2/((z[1] - z[2]) (z[1] - z[3])), s[2] -> -(z[2]/(z[1] (z[2] - z[3]))), s[3] -> 1/(z[1] z[2]), r[1] -> -(z[3]/z[2]), r[2] -> -(z[3]/z[1]), r[3] -> (z[2]^2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(z[1]^2 (z[2] - z[3]))};\nPaux = Simplify[Pma . Pda . Ppa /. rsSol];\nchecks[\"Paux G(z) Paux^-1 = diag(z)\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Paux . Gc[zs] . Inverse[Paux] - DiagonalMatrix[zs]]]] === {0};\nnumZW = Join[Thread[zs -> zN], Thread[ws -> wN]];\nGPzw = Simplify[Paux . Gc[ws] . Inverse[Paux]] /. numZW;\nrOm = {r1 -> (w[1] - z[1])/(w[1] - z[2]), r2 -> ((w[1] - z[1]) (-w[2] + z[1]) (z[2] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (w[2] - z[3])), r3 -> ((w[1] - z[2]) (-w[2] + z[2]) (z[1] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (-w[2] + z[3]))} /. numZW;\nΩ1 = First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . MatrixExp[(r1 /. rOm) Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[(r2 /. rOm) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[(r3 /. rOm) Ee[2, 3]]];\nΩ2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1, Ω1]];\ntW = Table[tPoly[GPzw, a], {a, 3}];\nkOm = Ordering[Abs[Ω2], -1][[1]];\ntauVac = Table[Expand[(Ω2 . tW[[a]])[[kOm]]/Ω2[[kOm]]], {a, 3}];\nchecks[\"Ωzw⊗Ωzw left eigenvector of t_a(G') (exact)\"] = And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[Expand[Ω2 . tW[[a]] - tauVac[[a]] Ω2]]] === {0}, {a, 3}];\nchecks[\"vacuum t1 = Σ w_j ν_j(u)\"] = Expand[tauVac[[1]] - Sum[wN[[j]] nuP[j][u], {j, 3}]] === 0;\nqdVac = Table[solveQ[opDir, N[tauVac, prec], wN[[i]], -1], {i, 3}];\nchecks[\"vacuum direct q's found, degrees (0,2,4)\"] = FreeQ[qdVac, {}] && Exponent[qdVac, X] === {0, 2, 4};\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{k, checks[k]}, {k, {\"Paux G(z) Paux^-1 = diag(z)\", \"Ωzw⊗Ωzw left eigenvector of t_a(G') (exact)\", \"vacuum t1 = Σ w_j ν_j(u)\", \"vacuum direct q's found, degrees (0,2,4)\"}}], {\"check\", \"value\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"141\" data-out-n=\"1094\" data-sub-idx=\"23\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1094]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">check</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Paux G(z) Paux</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1 = diag(z)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ωzw</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ωzw left eigenvector of t_a(G’) (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vacuum t1 = Σ w_j </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.06366em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">_j(u)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vacuum direct q’s found, degrees (0,2,4)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1094]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{check} & \\text{value}\\\\\\hline\\text{Paux G(z) Paux\\^{}-1 = diag(z)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Omega$zw$\\otimes$$\\Omega$zw left eigenvector of t\\_a(G') (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum t1 = $\\Sigma$ w\\_j $\\nu$\\_j(u)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum direct q's found, degrees (0,2,4)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7076047e-282b-4733-9073-1e565fead1b3"
