  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Two-site bracket and functional orthogonality\n**Bracket.** $\\langle f\\rangle=\\sum_{s,n}\\mathrm{Res}_{x=\\theta_s-nh}\\,\\rho f$ with $\\rho=\\prod_s\\prod_{n=\\lambda_3}^{\\lambda_1}(x-\\theta_s+nh)^{-1}$; at L=1 this is the clean notebook's bracket.\n\n**Columns.** At L=2, $\\delta t_1$ is linear and $\\delta t_2$ is cubic, while $\\delta t_3=0$. Split $\\delta t_2(y)=\\nu_1(y)A(y)+\\nu_3(y-h)B(y)$ with $A,B$ linear, as at L=1. That gives six unknowns, so six columns:\n$$-\\langle P Q\\rangle,\\ -\\langle xPQ\\rangle,\\ \\langle PQ^{[2]}\\rangle,\\ \\langle xPQ^{[2]}\\rangle,\\ \\langle P^{[-2]}Q\\rangle,\\ \\langle xP^{[-2]}Q\\rangle,$$\nwith $P=Q^j$ (the ket's dual) and $Q=Q_i$ (the bra's direct). The 9 pairs $(i,j)$ give a $9\\times6$ matrix. The prediction is rank 5 between different states at the same twist and rank 6 for the same state. This is tested without choosing any rows.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "poles = Flatten[Table[{s, n}, {s, nL}, {n, Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]}], 1];\nxP[{s_, n_}] := thN[[s]] - n hN;\nwgt[p_] := wgt[p] = 1/Product[xP[p] - xP[q], {q, DeleteCases[poles, p]}];\n(* full Q's at a rational point, memoized; A = state index, \"vac\" = the w-vacuum *)\nQU[A_, j_, x_] := QU[A, j, x] = N[zN[[j]]^(x/hN), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> x);\nQD[A_Integer, i_, x_] := QD[A, i, x] = N[zN[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qd[[A, i]] /. X -> x);\nQD[\"vac\", i_, x_] := QD[\"vac\", i, x] = N[wN[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qdVac[[i]] /. X -> x);\nrowF[B_, A_, {i_, j_}] := Sum[wgt[p] With[{x = xP[p]}, {-QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x], -x QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x], QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x + hN], x QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x + hN], QU[B, j, x - hN] QD[A, i, x], x QU[B, j, x - hN] QD[A, i, x]}], {p, poles}];\npairs9 = Tuples[Range[3], 2];\nM9[B_, A_] := Table[rowF[B, A, ij], {ij, pairs9}];\nsvr[m_] := With[{sv = SingularValueList[m, Tolerance -> 0]}, Last[sv]/First[sv]];\n{oTime, svTab} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[svr[M9[B, A]], {A, nS}, {B, nS}]];\nchecks[\"orthogonality: max σmin/σmax over A≠B\"] = Max[Table[If[A != B, svTab[[A, B]], 0], {A, nS}, {B, nS}]];\nchecks[\"orthogonality: min σmin/σmax over A=B (not a zero test)\"] = Min[Diagonal[svTab]];\n(* det N on the six off-diagonal rows, as a second view *)\nrows6 = Select[pairs9, #[[1]] != #[[2]] &];\ndetN[B_, A_] := Det[Table[rowF[B, A, ij], {ij, rows6}]];\ndetZ = Table[detN[B, A], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"det N off-diagonal/diagonal (same twist)\"] = Max[Abs[detZ - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[detZ]]]]/Min[Abs[Diagonal[detZ]]];\nGrid[Prepend[Append[Table[{k, ScientificForm[N[checks[k], 3], 3]}, {k, {\"orthogonality: max σmin/σmax over A≠B\", \"orthogonality: min σmin/σmax over A=B (not a zero test)\", \"det N off-diagonal/diagonal (same twist)\"}}], {\"time (s)\", oTime}], {\"check\", \"value\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
