  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Per-ladder brackets (FSoV structure)\nAt L=2 there are two independent brackets. Section 5's single bracket is only their sum. As in `old-conventions/old/XXX/Clean/XXX_CG_L2_Clean.wb` (cells 38–40), the measure $\\mu_\\alpha\\propto\\rho\\,(1-e^{2\\pi i(u-\\theta_{\\bar\\alpha})/h})$ kills the other ladder. Equivalently, the insertions $1$ and $e^{2\\pi iu/h}$ are constant on each ladder. So\n$$\\langle f\\rangle_\\alpha=\\sum_{n=\\lambda_3}^{\\lambda_1}\\mathrm{Res}_{x=\\theta_\\alpha-nh}\\,\\rho f,$$\nup to a constant per $\\alpha$, which only rescales rows. The structure is then:\n- **rows** $(i,j;\\alpha)$, a pair times a ladder;\n- **columns** $(\\text{type};\\beta)$, one of the three L=1 functionals times $x^{\\beta-1}$;\n- $\\det N$ is $6\\times6$, with the L=1 pairs $(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)$ times $\\alpha=1,2$.\n\nOrthogonality is tested on the full $18\\times6$ matrix (9 pairs × 2 ladders).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* row of ladder α only: the same residue weights, restricted to that ladder's poles *)\nrowFa[B_, A_, {i_, j_}, α_] := Sum[wgt[p] With[{x = xP[p]}, {-QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x], -x QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x], QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x + hN], x QU[B, j, x] QD[A, i, x + hN], QU[B, j, x - hN] QD[A, i, x], x QU[B, j, x - hN] QD[A, i, x]}], {p, Select[poles, #[[1]] == α &]}];\nM18[B_, A_] := Flatten[Table[rowFa[B, A, ij, α], {α, nL}, {ij, pairs9}], 1];\nsv18 = Table[svr[M18[B, A]], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"per-ladder orthogonality: max σmin/σmax over A≠B (18x6)\"] = Max[Table[If[A != B, sv18[[A, B]], 0], {A, nS}, {B, nS}]];\nchecks[\"per-ladder: min σmin/σmax over A=B (not a zero test)\"] = Min[Diagonal[sv18]];\ndetNa[B_, A_, prs_] := Det[Flatten[Table[rowFa[B, A, ij, α], {α, nL}, {ij, prs}], 1]];\nprsL1 = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}; prsAlt = {{1, 3}, {2, 1}, {3, 2}};\ndVa = Table[detNa[B, \"vac\", prsL1], {B, nS}]; dVaAlt = Table[detNa[B, \"vac\", prsAlt], {B, nS}];\ndZa = Table[detNa[B, A, prsL1], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"per-ladder det N off-diag/diag (same twist)\"] = Max[Abs[dZa - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[dZa]]]]/Min[Abs[Diagonal[dZa]]];\nchecks[\"per-ladder det N: pair-choice ratio state-independent (B vs vac)\"] = spread[dVaAlt/dVa];\nRBa = Table[ovl[[B]]/x0ovl[[B]] psiQ[B]/dVa[[B]], {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"per-ladder: R_B state-independent, site-product Ψ_Q(x0)\"] = spread[RBa];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{k, ScientificForm[N[checks[k], 3], 3]}, {k, {\"per-ladder orthogonality: max σmin/σmax over A≠B (18x6)\", \"per-ladder: min σmin/σmax over A=B (not a zero test)\", \"per-ladder det N off-diag/diag (same twist)\", \"per-ladder det N: pair-choice ratio state-independent (B vs vac)\", \"per-ladder: R_B state-independent, site-product Ψ_Q(x0)\"}}], {\"check\", \"value\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
