  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary of checks\nBoolean checks must be `True`. Numeric checks are residuals and must be below $10^{-25}$; the \"not a zero test\" entries are sizes and must be large.\n\n**Expected FAILs.** These rows are records of what does *not* work, not bugs:\n- the two R_B and row-choice checks from the single combined bracket (Section 6);\n- the per-ladder \"pair-choice\" check: the pairs $\\{(1,3),(2,1),(3,2)\\}$ are not equivalent to the L=1 pairs $\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$.\n\n**Main result (Sections 7–9).** In the diagonal frame, for all 64 eigenstates of the twist-$z$ chain,\n$$\\Omega^{(2)}\\cdot\\Psi_B=\\frac{\\Omega^{(2)}\\cdot y_0^{(2)}}{c_0\\,\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2\\,\\Phi_Q^{\\rm vac}(y_0)}\\;\\frac{\\det N[B,\\mathrm{vac}]}{\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)}\\;\\langle x_0^{(2)}|\\Psi_B\\rangle .$$\nIt holds to 50 digits. The ingredients:\n- $x_0^{(2)}$, $y_0^{(2)}$, $\\Psi_Q$ and $\\Phi_Q$ are products over sites;\n- $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2=(9h^4)^2$;\n- $\\det N$ has rows $(i,j;k)$ for $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$ and columns of type $\\times\\,x^{\\beta-1}$.\n\n**Preferred brackets (Section 9).** Both brackets go around all poles, with insertions $1$ and $e^{2\\pi iu/h}$. Then\n$$c_0=\\frac{(\\varepsilon_1-\\varepsilon_2)^3}{16h^{12}\\,\\theta_{12}^3(\\theta_{12}^2-h^2)^4(\\theta_{12}^2-4h^2)^2},\\qquad \\varepsilon_s=e^{2\\pi i\\theta_s/h},\\quad \\theta_{12}=\\theta_1-\\theta_2.$$\nThis is $(\\varepsilon_2-\\varepsilon_1)^3$ times the per-ladder $c_0$ of Section 7, as expected from the row mixing, and it was confirmed by direct computation.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "passQ[k_, v_] := Which[v === True, True, v === False, False, StringContainsQ[k, \"not a zero test\"], v > 10^-20, StringContainsQ[k, \"min gap\"], v > 10^-10, NumericQ[v], v < 10^-25, True, False];\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, If[NumericQ[#2], ScientificForm[N[#2, 3], 3], #2], If[passQ[#1, #2], Style[\"PASS\", Darker[Green]], Style[\"FAIL\", Red]]} &, checks], {\"check\", \"value\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
